# Neon's Data API and Neon Auth, derived from one base URL. Safe to expose: the
# endpoint is public by design, and every row is limited to the signed-in
# account by row-level security (db/0001_schema.sql). Never put a Postgres
# connection string here — it is an owner credential and bypasses RLS.
#
# Leave it unset and the app uses an in-memory stand-in for the database: any
# email and password signs in, and the library stays in that browser. Fine for
# development; the deploy refuses to build without it.
VITE_NEON_BASE_URL=https://<endpoint>.<region>.aws.neon.tech/neondb
